### 🔴 `age` — 5 ISSUES (3 Types)
| # | Row | Value   | Issue Type      | Severity | Detection Method        |
|---|-----|---------|-----------------|----------|-------------------------|
| 1 |  3  | *(empty)* | Missing value   | 🟡 HIGH  | Column profiling        |
| 2 |  5  | 150     | Extreme outlier | 🔴 CRITICAL | IQR (≥94 = outlier, Z=2.81σ) |
